flowchart LR 
    REQ["Client Request (Camunda / API)"] --> TR["Traefik"] 
    TR --> KS["KServe InferenceService"] 
    KS --> MODEL["Model Execution (Champion)"] 
    MODEL --> RESP["Immediate Response"] 
    RESP --> TR 
    TR --> CLIENT["Client Response"] 
    %% optional async side output (non-blocking) 
    KS -. async fire-and-forget .-> LOG["Async Event Logger (non-blocking)"]